XLinkArray|XLinkArray: postInitialize can return false at 2 places; read from the decompile: the call named is the nearest before a false return, not proof of cause.
ZonauBlockMaster|ZonauBlockMaster: it has no stage of its own and uses the shared base stages, whose only failure is its parameter document not loading; the game's notice for that, with the file path, is listed under the verdict when it was captured.
ZonauGearControl|ZonauGearControl: it reads its ZonauGearControlParam parameters (OnStateTerrorLevel, OnStateTerrorIsCapsule, OnStateTerrorRadius, OnStateTerrorCapsuleLength, OnStateTerrorCapsuleAxis, OnStateTerrorOffset, EnergyConsumptionRate, IsSetCustomEnergyRange); postInitialize can return false at 4 places; read from the decompile: the call named is the nearest before a false return, not proof of cause.
